.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a time-bounded GPU NVMe I/O benchmark against one or more devices.
All devices run in parallel: one CUDA block per queue, all queues launched
in a single kernel. All devices must use the same LBA size.
.SH REQUIRED
.TP
.B
\fB--iopattern\fP STRING
IO pattern (read, write, randread, randwrite)
.TP
.B
\fB--qdepth\fP NUM
Use given 'NUM' as queue max capacity
.TP
.B
\fB--iosize\fP NUM
Use given 'NUM' as bs/iosize
.TP
.B
\fB--runtime\fP NUM
Run for 'NUM' seconds
.RE
.PP

.SH OPTIONAL
